# Build output
Binaries/
Intermediates/
/External/
External.7z
External-Linux64.tar.gz

# Packaged game output
Engine/*/Build/

# Crash and log artifacts
/CrashDumps/
/Saved/
/*.log
/newworld_cooked.bin
/newworld_decomp.bin

# IDE state
/.idea/
/.vs/
*.user
*.DotSettings
**/Scripts/.idea/
**/Scripts/.vs/

# Generated IDE projects. LuminaBuildTool writes these into Intermediates/ProjectFiles, which is
# already covered above; these patterns catch stray copies left by older generators.
*.sln
*.slnx
*.vcxproj
*.filters

# Compile database for clangd and clang-tidy, written at the workspace root because that is where
# those tools look. Machine specific: it holds absolute toolchain paths. .cache/ is the index
# clangd builds from it.
compile_commands.json
.cache/

# Editor scratch. Written wherever the editor's working directory happens to be, so it is matched
# by name rather than by path.
imgui.ini
Engine/Editor/Config/EditorSettings.json
Engine/Editor/Config/EditorPreferences.json

# Compiler and linker intermediates
*.d
*.o
*.obj
*.slo
*.lo
*.gch
*.pch
*.pdb
*.idb
*.tlog

# Compiled libraries
*.so
*.dylib
*.a
*.lai
*.la

# Fortran module files
*.mod
*.smod

# Executables
*.out
*.app

# .NET build output
obj/
bin/
*.pyc

# Generated C# projects: the *.Scripts.csproj are emitted by the runtime script host. The engine's
# own managed projects are hand-authored source now that LuminaBuildTool replaced premake.
*.Scripts.csproj

# Reflector-emitted C# bindings, written into the owning unit's script tree so they compile with it.
**/Scripts/Generated/

# Local assistant notes
/.claude/
CLAUDE.md

*.zip
